<title>FRANCE: FRENCH JUNE M3 MONEY SUPPLY FLAT.</title>
<headline>FRENCH JUNE M3 MONEY SUPPLY FLAT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of France gave the following money supply figures on Thursday.</p>
<p> Money measure  Billions   Monthly change    12-month change</p>
<p>(end-June)	(unadj)	(adjusted)	  (unadjusted)</p>
<p>				    June   May	  June</p>
<p>    M1	    1,752.7     1.3    1.3	   3.2</p>
<p>    M2	    3,360.9     1.2    1.1	   6.5</p>
<p>    M3	    5,258.6     0.0    0.2	  -0.9</p>
<p>    M4	    5,351.3     0.0    0.2	  -1.0</p>
<p> Investment     2,038.0     0.8    1.0	  14.8</p>
<p> Credit measure	 Billions    month/month	 year/year</p>
<p> (end-May)		(unadj)	 end-May	    end-May</p>
<p> Tot. domestic debt   11,028.6	 0.2		  2.6</p>
<p>of which:</p>
<p>  state		    3,723.5	 ---		  7.0</p>
<p>  credits to economy   6,283.3	 0.1		 -1.8</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
